-- Published: six cities with five or more active rows whose owners state American / NMJL on their own pages and whose sessions are in named public venues. Left out for now: Boulder (its other sessions are at a classroom on a residential street), Nashville GA (street address only, membership club), Longview TX and Cherokee Village AR (no beginner wording, open play only), Aurora CO (sessions are at a library in Centennial), Daphne AL (venue is the club's own name), Fresno CA (two of its rows have no American wording).
UPDATE "City" SET "published" = 1, "intro" = 'In Champaign, American mahjong meets in two public venues. Farren''s at The Inman runs its Mahjong & Mocktails evenings, pairing an instructed American Mahjong 101 session with a guided-play night for people who know the basics. Grovestone hosts a daytime American Mahjong 102 review and guided-play class led by an instructor. Sessions are ticketed in advance through Eventbrite, so book before you go. If you are new, begin with the instructed 101 evening, then move on to guided play once the tiles and the Charleston feel familiar.' WHERE "slug" = 'champaign';
UPDATE "City" SET "published" = 1, "intro" = 'Gainesville''s American mahjong is run by Blue Ridge Mahj, which takes the game to wineries and breweries around Northern Virginia. Evenings alternate between Mahjong 101 or open play, Mahjong 102 skills sessions and plain open play, at places such as The Winery at Sunshine Ridge Farm in Gainesville, with others at Trouvaille Brewing in Haymarket and Old Bust Head Brewing in New Baltimore. Tickets are sold online in advance. New players can choose the Mahjong 101 option and learn the basics at the table before joining open play.' WHERE "slug" = 'gainesville';
UPDATE "City" SET "published" = 1, "intro" = 'House of Four Winds Mahjong brings American mahjong to Nokesville and the countryside around it. Beginner Mahjong 101 classes are held at Vita Nova Creatives & Coffee in Nokesville, while open play moves between local vineyards and breweries such as Three Fox in Delaplane and Buckland Farm Market in Warrenton. Tickets are sold in advance online. If you have never played, the Mahjong 101 class at Vita Nova is the place to start; it is built for complete beginners and needs no prior experience.' WHERE "slug" = 'nokesville';
UPDATE "City" SET "published" = 1, "intro" = 'Webster Groves has a home for American mahjong at Paisley Boutique on West Lockwood Avenue, where the shop hosts learn-to-play classes, Mahjong 102 guided play and drop-in Mahj Social open play on weekday afternoons and Saturday mornings, plus brunch sessions on Sundays. Tickets are sold online. The Learn to Play Mahjong 101 class walks you through the basics of American mahjong, so complete beginners are welcome, and the guided sessions are a good next step once you can follow a hand.' WHERE "slug" = 'webster-groves';
UPDATE "City" SET "published" = 1, "intro" = 'Sparrow & Palm hosts American mahjong in Bonita Springs, on Old 41 Road. Its calendar mixes drop-in open play with beginner, intermediate and advanced tables, multi-week beginner and strategy lesson courses, and social brunch sessions on Saturdays. Check the schedule before you go and register for lessons ahead of time. If you are new to the game, the Beginner Mahjong Lesson Course is the place to start before you move on to the open tables.' WHERE "slug" = 'bonita-springs';
UPDATE "City" SET "published" = 1, "intro" = 'Sparrow''s in Haddonfield hosts American mahjong on its Dragons After Dark nights, Tuesday evenings on Mechanic Street. The programme alternates open play with Mahj 101 lessons, so you can either join a table or learn the game from the beginning. Tickets are sold online in advance. If you are new to American mahjong, pick a Mahj 101 lesson night; the lesson covers the basics before you sit down at an open-play table.' WHERE "slug" = 'haddonfield';
UPDATE "City" SET "published" = 1, "intro" = 'Mariposa Mahjong teaches American mahjong around Downers Grove, with Mahjong 101 and Mahjong 102 sessions at Roasted Elements Coffee in Downers Grove and at Tony Spavone''s Ristorante in neighbouring Bloomingdale. The 102 afternoons add guided play, so newer players can practise what they learned with help at the table. Tickets are sold in advance through Eventbrite, so book ahead. If you are brand new, start with a Mahjong 101 session; it introduces the game from the beginning.' WHERE "slug" = 'downers-grove';
